    "name": "Elemental Labyrinth",
    "steam_appid": 3516960,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516960/extras/cbb80a7b95384383d80d76d98ad56302.avif?t=1749963856\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Elemental Labyrinth</i> is a pixel-art tower defense game where you shape the battlefield and control the flow of battle. Construct your own maze to dictate enemy paths, summon random elemental Spirits, and fuse them into stronger forms to counter relentless waves of foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Spirit wields unique abilities\u2014combine them strategically to create powerful synergies and adapt to ever-growing threats. Experiment with different layouts, Spirit combinations to perfect your defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With retro-inspired pixel art, deep tactical gameplay, and endless strategic possibilities, <i>Elemental Labyrinth</i> offers a fresh take on the tower defense genre. Will your labyrinth stand the test of time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f<strong>Build your own maze</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516960/extras/4c5342f38bf2f61bca72c29cd98dbee5.poster.avif?t=1749963856\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516960/extras/4c5342f38bf2f61bca72c29cd98dbee5.webm?t=1749963856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516960/extras/4c5342f38bf2f61bca72c29cd98dbee5.mp4?t=1749963856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each wave, summon five random elemental blocks. Select one to keep, while the others become part of your maze\u2014shaping enemy paths and dictating their approach. Plan carefully to create the perfect labyrinth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf2a\ufe0f<strong>Call Forth Spirits with Elemental Fusion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516960/extras/8e411014ba75149808c7f8b351b4b4a3.poster.avif?t=1749963856\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516960/extras/8e411014ba75149808c7f8b351b4b4a3.webm?t=1749963856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516960/extras/8e411014ba75149808c7f8b351b4b4a3.mp4?t=1749963856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuse base elements in different combinations to summon powerful Spirits. Each fusion unlocks unique abilities, allowing for endless strategic possibilities. Experiment to find the strongest combinations for your defense!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f<strong>Discover Unique Spirits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516960/extras/553997e2c0a01eb1dcc9b32774576a05.poster.avif?t=1749963856\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516960/extras/553997e2c0a01eb1dcc9b32774576a05.webm?t=1749963856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516960/extras/553997e2c0a01eb1dcc9b32774576a05.mp4?t=1749963856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over <strong>50 unique Spirits</strong> (and more on the way), mix and match different formations to find the best synergies. Understand them all to create the ultimate defensive lineup!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd1d<strong>Collaborate with friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516960/extras/c3984f8ba8c92197364b4d58bad28590.avif?t=1749963856\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with other players online to build defenses faster and hold off even tougher enemy waves. But be warned\u2014cooperation comes with a challenge, as enemies grow stronger to match your combined power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80<strong>Future updates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're constantly working on new content! Expect more <strong>game modes, Spirits, and features</strong> in future updates. Stay tuned for exciting additions to the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516960/extras/d2de6dba1e2739429b8aa3606f21735f.avif?t=1749963856\" width=598 height=187 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516960/extras/cbb80a7b95384383d80d76d98ad56302.avif?t=1749963856\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Elemental Labyrinth</i> is a pixel-art tower defense game where you shape the battlefield and control the flow of battle. Construct your own maze to dictate enemy paths, summon random elemental Spirits, and fuse them into stronger forms to counter relentless waves of foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Spirit wields unique abilities\u2014combine them strategically to create powerful synergies and adapt to ever-growing threats. Experiment with different layouts, Spirit combinations to perfect your defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With retro-inspired pixel art, deep tactical gameplay, and endless strategic possibilities, <i>Elemental Labyrinth</i> offers a fresh take on the tower defense genre. Will your labyrinth stand the test of time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f<strong>Build your own maze</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516960/extras/4c5342f38bf2f61bca72c29cd98dbee5.poster.avif?t=1749963856\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516960/extras/4c5342f38bf2f61bca72c29cd98dbee5.webm?t=1749963856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516960/extras/4c5342f38bf2f61bca72c29cd98dbee5.mp4?t=1749963856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each wave, summon five random elemental blocks. Select one to keep, while the others become part of your maze\u2014shaping enemy paths and dictating their approach. Plan carefully to create the perfect labyrinth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf2a\ufe0f<strong>Call Forth Spirits with Elemental Fusion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516960/extras/8e411014ba75149808c7f8b351b4b4a3.poster.avif?t=1749963856\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516960/extras/8e411014ba75149808c7f8b351b4b4a3.webm?t=1749963856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516960/extras/8e411014ba75149808c7f8b351b4b4a3.mp4?t=1749963856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuse base elements in different combinations to summon powerful Spirits. Each fusion unlocks unique abilities, allowing for endless strategic possibilities. Experiment to find the strongest combinations for your defense!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f<strong>Discover Unique Spirits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516960/extras/553997e2c0a01eb1dcc9b32774576a05.poster.avif?t=1749963856\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516960/extras/553997e2c0a01eb1dcc9b32774576a05.webm?t=1749963856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516960/extras/553997e2c0a01eb1dcc9b32774576a05.mp4?t=1749963856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over <strong>50 unique Spirits</strong> (and more on the way), mix and match different formations to find the best synergies. Understand them all to create the ultimate defensive lineup!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd1d<strong>Collaborate with friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516960/extras/c3984f8ba8c92197364b4d58bad28590.avif?t=1749963856\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with other players online to build defenses faster and hold off even tougher enemy waves. But be warned\u2014cooperation comes with a challenge, as enemies grow stronger to match your combined power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80<strong>Future updates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're constantly working on new content! Expect more <strong>game modes, Spirits, and features</strong> in future updates. Stay tuned for exciting additions to the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516960/extras/d2de6dba1e2739429b8aa3606f21735f.avif?t=1749963856\" width=598 height=187 /></span></p>",
